    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26065" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατῑμ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>finish honouring, honour no longer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦδε διατετίμηται θεοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					1052
				</span></i>
			 Sch. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦδ᾽ οὐ</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>get</i> a thing <i>estimated</i> or <i>valued,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν οὐσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀδίκημα ταλάντων πεντακοσίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					16.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					13.9.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2266.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				679.60
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>:—also in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				26.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Le.</u>
				27.14
			</span></i>.</div>
